#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/layers.rst:171
msgid "Display settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/layers.rst:176
msgid ""
"You can select the active layer here. Using the :kbd:`Shift` and :kbd:`Ctrl` "
"keys you can select multiple layers and drag-and-drop them. You can also "
"change the visibility, edit state, alpha inheritance and rename layers. You "
"can open and close groups, and you can drag and drop layers, either to "
"reorder them, or to put them in groups."
msgstr ""
"在图层列表中点击可以选择活动图层，拖放可以改变图层顺序。按住 :kbd:`Shift` "
"或 :kbd:`Ctrl` 可以进行多选，被选中的多个图层可以同时拖放。图层可以分组，每个"
"图层组可以随时展开和折叠。你还可以在这里重命名图层、更改图层可见性、锁定状"
"态、继承透明度等属性。"

